 was excellent but the rooms were a bit small. The staff were friendly and the amenities were good.\n                </p>\n            </p>\n            <p class=\"review\">\n                <strong>Rated 4/5</strong> - <strong>Robert Smith</strong>\n                <br>\n                <p class=\"review-text\">\n                    The rooms were comfortable but the amenities were a bit basic. The location was perfect for my needs.\n                </p>\n            </p>\n            <h1>Booking Information</h1>\n            <p>\n                <strong>Book your stay today</strong> and experience the best of our hotel.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n                <strong>Call us</strong> at 123-456-7890 or visit our <strong>booking page</strong> for more information.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
